{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Tweeny Witches: The Adventures","\"Tweeny Witches\" The Adventure created by Studio 4C in collaboration with \"Garo\" creator Keita Amemiya. Includes the Alice chapters \"Sakana ni Natta Maho Shojotai\" and \"Fuin Sareta Kokoro,\" Sheila chapters \"Yosei Hakusho\" and \"Kori no Majo to Hien no Taki,\" and Eva chapters \"Dragon House no Himitsu\" and \"Shippu Doto no Maho Shojotai\" on three DVDs. Created during the original run of the TV series but never released until it came out on DVD."],"ja":["魔法少女隊アルス THE ADVENTURE",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-3991","ids":{"shikimori":3991,"mal":3991,"anilist":3991,"kodik":"serial-28849"},"kodikIds":["serial-28849"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28849":"2020-08-21T11:18:34Z"},"title":"Отряд волшебниц Арусу: Приключения","originalTitle":"Mahou Shoujo Tai The Adventure","alt":"Tweeny Witches: The Adventures / Maho Shojo Tai Arusu: The Adventure / Tweeny Witches OVA Tweeny Witches: The Adventures 魔法少女隊アルス THE ADVENTURE","description":"«Ведьмочки» — приключенческая история, созданная студией 4°C в сотрудничестве с Кэйтой Амэмией, создателем «Гаро». В комплект на трёх DVD входят главы про Алису «Sakana ni Natta Maho Shojotai» и «Fuin Sareta Kokoro», главы про Шейлу «Yosei Hakusho» и «Kori no Majo to Hien no Taki», а также главы про Еву «Dragon House no Himitsu» и «Shippu Doto no Maho Shojotai».","year":2007,"type":"OVA","genres":["Приключения","Комедия","Фэнтези","исэкай"],"rating":6.7,"popularity":1786,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/3991/0776ef57493998ad1edfaaebd19bab23.jpeg","width":321,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/a650e91463f1188caef2d0a86b2c971f8f048411.jpg","width":853,"height":480}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-674","dubId":"674","label":"Люб. Одноголосый","language